# Notes for building the Debian package

## Compatibility with gbp-buildpackage and sbuild

This package has been confirmed to build correctly using the following
command line:

```bash
gbp buildpackage --git-ignore-branch --git-builder='sbuild --no-clean-source -d bookworm' --git-upstream-tree=@
```

## Lintian options for sbuild

This package passes Lintian with the following config in `~/.sbuildrc`:

```perl
$run_lintian = 1;
$lintian_opts = ['--display-info', '--verbose', '--fail-on', 'error,warning', '--info', '--suppress-tags', 'bad-distribution-in-changes-file,changelog-distribution-does-not-match-changes-file,unreleased-changes'];
```
